/// A module nested two levels deep, for the decided rule "an import binds its
/// LEAF name" (spec §9): `import A::B::Nested;` binds `Nested`, so
/// `Nested::value()` is legal without spelling the full path again.
///
/// `value` returns 42 and nothing else in the project declares it, so this
/// pins the binding rule rather than a collision.
![config(testing)]
namespace ResolutionScope::Deep::Nested;

function value() -> i32 { return 42; }
